        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hm, where am I？
Everything's white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...It's slowly clearing up.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh!! ▲高嶺＊＊▲!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's she doing here... Oh,
I get it, this is a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...If it's a dream, she
won't get mad if I touch
her, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, let's try
touching her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...That surprised me. She
reacts even in a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Can I touch her a little
more？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Seems like she's happy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...She doesn't like it. So
sometimes it's a no.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>She looks really happy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>People will see us...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her responses are 
different depending on 
where I touch her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So depending on her mood,
there are places I can touch
and places I can't.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And the number of times I
can touch her seems to
change with her mood too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder where I can touch
her. Let's try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hair... a boyfriend's
privilege.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... kind of
cute.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her ear... I wonder if it
tickles.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her body... I need to be
careful here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her arm... it'd be nice to
link arms.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hand... I want to hold
hands, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Apparently, this won't do.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hair, forehead, ears, body,
arms, hands... that's about
it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Huh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, the world's going white
again... Over already？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Just a little longer...
▲高嶺＊＊▲, waaait！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Where am I？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh right, a dream. Still,
that was a vivid dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But I shouldn't be satisfied
with just a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'll do it
properly on our dates！</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
