        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where is this？ There's no
one here...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What, everything's
suddenly going white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Come to think of it, I feel
like I've had a dream like
this before...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲高嶺＊＊▲ is so close...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And the mood is kind of
nice.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Could I kiss her？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Last time I could only tap,
but this time let's try
stroking.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her reaction changes a bit
depending on how I touch
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, this time let's
touch only her cheek.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, she doesn't want me
touching there？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I think it would be best 
not to do that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe I'll try touching a
little longer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So if I touch her for
longer, she's happy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her expression changes
sometimes depending on where
I touch.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where can I touch, I wonder.
Let's just try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her head... looks like I can
pat it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... looks like I
can touch it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her cheek... I can touch
here too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Around her shoulders...
seems fine here too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Not here, huh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, I'd better not do
this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Head, forehead, cheeks,
around the shoulders... I'm
starting to get it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hm？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Something's different...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What on earth...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Does this mean I can kiss
her after all？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Even if it's a dream, is it
really okay...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But if I think of it as a
rehearsal, it's fine.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Now what？ It's a kiss, so
the lips are the basics,
right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But maybe light kisses on
her forehead, cheek, or
around her mouth are okay
too？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, let's just try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Seems a light touch on her
cheek is best.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A kiss on the forehead...
this could be nice too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Around her mouth... maybe
just a light touch is best.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Lightly touching her lips
like this works too, huh.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Except for the lips, it
seems I can't kiss very
long.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...This is no good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I ended up getting carried
away...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, let me regroup and try
again.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I just need to keep touching
her lips...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Even though it's a dream,
I'm getting a strange
feeling...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I need to make it longer...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, no, I have to kiss her
lips.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>This is a no-go.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Having a dream like this...
am I pent up？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Too embarrassing. I can't
tell ▲高嶺＊＊▲ about
this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, everything's going white
again... so this is the end.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm a little sad to leave,
but it's just a dream after
all...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>After a dream like this, I
can't face ▲高嶺＊＊▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, I just need to be able
to do it for real, not in a
dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'll do my best
on our next date！</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
